<li>Cornell, J. E. &amp; Mulrow, C. D. (1999). Meta-analysis. In: H. J. Adèr &amp; G. J. Mellenbergh (Eds). Research Methodology in the social, behavioral and life sciences (pp.&amp;nbsp;285–323). London: Sage.</li>
<li>Sutton, A.J., Jones, D.R., Abrams, K.R., Sheldon, T.A., &amp; Song, F. (2000). Methods for Meta-analysis in Medical Research. London: John Wiley.</li>
